@@ -1 +1,2 @@
 add `--macos-sample-buffer-layer` and `--macos-dovi-rpu-file`
+add `--macos-sample-buffer-edr` option
diff --git a/DOCS/man/options.rst b/DOCS/man/options.rst
index 25082a2bc..b9df28a97 100644
--- a/DOCS/man/options.rst
+++ b/DOCS/man/options.rst
@@ -7264,6 +7264,11 @@ them.
     counts from the first), the last one with every frame after it; a file with one RPU applies to all.
     Can be changed while playing.
 
+``--macos-sample-buffer-edr=<yes|no>``
+    Whether ``--macos-sample-buffer-layer`` shows HDR frames with the display's extended dynamic range
+    (default: yes), or has macOS tone them down to SDR, as on an SDR display (with a Dolby Vision RPU,
+    by its trims for SDR). Can be changed while playing.
+
 ``--macos-menu-shortcuts=<yes|no>``
     Enables the default menu bar shortcuts (default: yes). The menu bar shortcuts always take
     precedence over any other shortcuts, they are not propagated to the mpv core and they can't be
